      "side": 1,
      "message": "Health PDI:\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/blob/808b2b794199f65dfec970a626cebc7200db660a/yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/State/Decorator/OperationalStatus.interface.yaml#L9\n\nPresence PDI: \nhttps://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/blob/808b2b794199f65dfec970a626cebc7200db660a/yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Item.interface.yaml#L14\n\n`OperationalStatus`, corresponding to health state set, is default to false due to the definition in the existing PDI.\n`Present`, corresponding to presence state set, doesn\u0027t have any default value defined in existing PDI, I simply aligns it to the case of `OperationalStatus`.\n\nFor this newly introduced `LinkStatus`, corresponding to Link State, it is new and remain unmerged in PDI. Happy to change its default value to false if you insists.\n\nPlease find the patch in the following link:\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/93593",
